    <Date>2021-01-13</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0096","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ingrid Blanc talks about negative space and its landlord. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
